Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "FiraCode Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1440
Set Height 560
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 0

Hide
Type `exec env -u XDG_CONFIG_HOME -u CONVEYOR_CONFIG -u XDG_STATE_HOME -u CONVEYOR_LOG HOME="$CONVEYOR_DEMO_HOME" "$CONVEYOR_DEMO_BIN" --demo`
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Down@600ms 2
Sleep 600ms
Type "d"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "l"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "l"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "j"
Sleep 2s
Type "l"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "hhh"
Sleep 1s
Type "S"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
